        "body": "A face may render glyph-shaped artwork without being named Icon. It is still a face. Every authored Surface starts with at least one face and ends in its ordinary Glyph; the terminal Glyph does not replace the face.\n\nThe terminal belongs to the selected track. Never select another Surface’s glyph merely because it appears first in the file.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "_placement": {
