        "body": "Source (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/components/TypeGlyph.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/glyphDefinition.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/surfaceChains.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/portDeclarations.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/glyphDefinition.test.js`\n- `tests/surfaceChains.test.js`\n- `tests/hitboxGlyph.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior.",
